{"seq":5,"slug":"chemistry","title":"高三化学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":3,"docCount":9,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/chemistry","introMarkdown":"# 高三化学 简介\n\n高三化学进入高考总复习阶段，核心目标是打通无机化学、有机化学和反应原理三大板块之间的知识壁垒，建立从物质结构到化学性质再到实际应用的完整推理链条。高考化学的综合性极强，一道题可能同时考查元素化合物、反应原理和实验操作，因此系统整合和跨板块联系是备考的关键。\n\n本知识库面向高三年级理科学生，适合已完成高中化学全部课程、进入系统备考阶段的学习者。全书共分三章，覆盖高考化学复习的核心路径。\n\n第一章**无机化学综合复习**以元素周期表和元素周期律为主线，系统梳理常见金属元素（钠、铝、铁、铜）和非金属元素（碳、氮、硫、氯）的化合物性质，强化离子方程式书写、氧化还原反应分析和物质推断等核心能力。第二章**有机化学综合复习**系统回顾有机物的结构与性质，强化官能团的识别与转化、同分异构体的书写和有机合成路线的设计，重点突破高考有机推断题和合成路线分析题。第三章**化学备考实战**讲解高考化学的命题规律和答题策略，重点分析工业流程题、实验综合题和化学计算题的解题方法，帮助学生建立完整的化学思维框架和规范的答题习惯。\n\n推荐无机和有机两大板块交替复习，每完成一轮专题复习后进行综合模拟检测。化学备考要特别注重实验操作和计算的规范性。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"inorganic-review","title":"无机化学综合复习","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/chemistry/inorganic-review","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"element-chemistry","title":"高三化学 — 元素化学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/chemistry/inorganic-review/element-chemistry"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reaction-types","title":"高三化学 — 反应类型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/chemistry/inorganic-review/reaction-types"},{"seq":3,"slug":"solution-equilibrium","title":"高三化学 — 溶液平衡","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/chemistry/inorganic-review/solution-equilibrium"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"organic-review","title":"有机化学综合复习","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/chemistry/organic-review","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"organic-synthesis","title":"高三化学 — 有机合成路线","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/chemistry/organic-review/organic-synthesis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"spectral-analysis","title":"高三化学 — 结构推断","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/chemistry/organic-review/spectral-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"experimental-chemistry","title":"高三化学 — 化学实验","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/chemistry/organic-review/experimental-chemistry"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"chemistry-exam","title":"化学备考实战","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/chemistry/chemistry-exam","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"choice-strategy","title":"高三化学 — 选择题策略","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/chemistry/chemistry-exam/choice-strategy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"comprehensive-problems","title":"高三化学 — 综合题突破","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/chemistry/chemistry-exam/comprehensive-problems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"chemistry-mock-analysis","title":"高三化学 — 模拟试题解析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-3/chemistry/chemistry-exam/chemistry-mock-analysis"}]}]}